{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/al-haseen-residence-dugasta-dubai-industrial-city","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":342,"crm_id":"2212","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Al Haseen Residence ","slug":"al-haseen-residence-dugasta-dubai-industrial-city","display_address":"Dubai Industrial City","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"Ready ","developer":"Dugasta","price":1015740,"display_price":"1.01M","lattitude":24.876337,"longitude":55.0470209,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Al Haseen Residence 1 this is distinguished 6-storey residential complex by Dugasta that redefines urban living with thoughtful designs and plain spaces harmoniously integrated with nature.</p><p>Nestled in a tranquil setting, Al Haseen invites residents to wander and wonder amidst the serenity of their surroundings. This building offers a variety of modern living spaces, including <strong>1-bedroom apartments, 2-bedroom apartments, and studios.</strong> Each residence is meticulously crafted to blend simplicity with elegance, and the interior finishing stands out for its comfort and the ability for residents to decorate their homes to their taste.</p><p>Residents of Al Haseen enjoy access to a range of amenities including a fully equipped gym for fitness enthusiasts, a refreshing swimming pool for relaxation, and ample parking for convenience.</p><p>Strategically located in Dubai Industrial City, Al Haseen offers easy access to key destinations: Dubai Investment Park is 10-12 minutes away, Palm Jebel Ali and Jumeirah Village Circle are 20-25 minutes away, District 2020 — 15-20 minutes away, Dubai Sports City is 20-25 minutes away. For those who enjoy diverse shopping experiences, Ibn Battuta Mall (15-20 minutes) and Mall of the Emirates (20-25 minutes) are also conveniently located, providing a wide array of stores, restaurants, and entertainment options. This strategic location makes Al Haseen an ideal place to live, combining comfort with easy access to essential amenities.</p><p>Whether you're drawn to the tranquility of nature or the vibrancy of urban life, Al Haseen provides a perfect living balance.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2212/images/2024/06/14/6GQbOcsJ2K5oVSiTnR4dB4ot2xKWVGjZg7B2ptiD.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/14/6GQbOcsJ2K5oVSiTnR4dB4ot2xKWVGjZg7B2ptiD.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2212/images/2024/06/14/mkNku1UN3vgY67cv3vOUixKnn4mDHmELvgG9HFEk.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/14/mkNku1UN3vgY67cv3vOUixKnn4mDHmELvgG9HFEk.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2212/images/2024/06/14/ZzqxRI4HVf75ufMuUr2cEcRLUa573yn5Uhpi6Gzu.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/14/ZzqxRI4HVf75ufMuUr2cEcRLUa573yn5Uhpi6Gzu.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2212/images/2024/06/14/v4rNT0TgUYN8RK17VyStYWWF0PisoOQ5YMkU50Nz.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/14/v4rNT0TgUYN8RK17VyStYWWF0PisoOQ5YMkU50Nz.jpg","__ggfxIndex":3},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2212/images/2024/06/14/f1YMGMPxaFxcCdLwreq6JgquSwEfeF0vfAAnuNm1.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/14/f1YMGMPxaFxcCdLwreq6JgquSwEfeF0vfAAnuNm1.jpg","__ggfxIndex":4}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2747,"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/2024/06/14/9AEKzAkrE3FnvIR0iUufVimaYZlmQ3JD0E83SX69.pdf","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":1532,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":1527,"u